{"data":{"featured":{"edges":[{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"DAimKart","cover":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/png;base64,"},"images":{"fallback":{"src":"/portfolio/static/bed555947ce05bccc57cbe933b17469e/e3559/DAimKart.png","srcSet":"/portfolio/static/bed555947ce05bccc57cbe933b17469e/091ca/DAimKart.png 175w,\n/portfolio/static/bed555947ce05bccc57cbe933b17469e/a0f71/DAimKart.png 350w,\n/portfolio/static/bed555947ce05bccc57cbe933b17469e/e3559/DAimKart.png 700w,\n/portfolio/static/bed555947ce05bccc57cbe933b17469e/e2ad1/DAimKart.png 1400w","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/portfolio/static/bed555947ce05bccc57cbe933b17469e/b3c4a/DAimKart.avif 175w,\n/portfolio/static/bed555947ce05bccc57cbe933b17469e/f2d21/DAimKart.avif 350w,\n/portfolio/static/bed555947ce05bccc57cbe933b17469e/4ad58/DAimKart.avif 700w,\n/portfolio/static/bed555947ce05bccc57cbe933b17469e/f5b29/DAimKart.avif 1400w","type":"image/avif","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},{"srcSet":"/portfolio/static/bed555947ce05bccc57cbe933b17469e/a9eff/DAimKart.webp 175w,\n/portfolio/static/bed555947ce05bccc57cbe933b17469e/31331/DAimKart.webp 350w,\n/portfolio/static/bed555947ce05bccc57cbe933b17469e/62ffd/DAimKart.webp 700w,\n/portfolio/static/bed555947ce05bccc57cbe933b17469e/c6f14/DAimKart.webp 1400w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"}]},"width":700,"height":302}}},"tech":["Python","Django","HTML","Bootstrap","CSS"],"github":"https://github.com/kappu777/DAimKart"},"html":"<p>DAimKart is a modern hyperlocal grocery ordering platform designed to digitally empower local neighborhood grocery (kirana) stores. Instead of competing with small businesses, DAimKart helps them expand their reach by enabling customers to browse products, place orders, and receive deliveries from nearby stores through a simple web and mobile experience.</p>"}},{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"Billing System","cover