ss data handling for businesses. This tool simplifies billing while offering comprehensive management of retail operations.</p>"}},{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"Railway Feedback","cover":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/png;base64,"},"images":{"fallback":{"src":"/portfolio/static/bc78cd6dd0ac7b6da039ba61a6cb33e4/2b514/demo.png","srcSet":"/portfolio/static/bc78cd6dd0ac7b6da039ba61a6cb33e4/b13f7/demo.png 175w,\n/portfolio/static/bc78cd6dd0ac7b6da039ba61a6cb33e4/771b8/demo.png 350w,\n/portfolio/static/bc78cd6dd0ac7b6da039ba61a6cb33e4/2b514/demo.png 700w,\n/portfolio/static/bc78cd6dd0ac7b6da039ba61a6cb33e4/c7ef4/demo.png 1400w","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/portfolio/static/bc78cd6dd0ac7b6da039ba61a6cb33e4/9d1e9/demo.avif 175w,\n/portfolio/static/bc78cd6dd0ac7b6da039ba61a6cb33e4/e3526/demo.avif 350w,\n/portfolio/static/bc78cd6dd0ac7b6da039ba61a6cb33e4/5fe96/demo.avif 700w,\n/portfolio/static/bc78cd6dd0ac7b6da039ba61a6cb33e4/6134c/demo.avif 1400w","type":"image/avif","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},{"srcSet":"/portfolio/static/bc78cd6dd0ac7b6da039ba61a6cb33e4/d75a4/demo.webp 175w,\n/portfolio/static/bc78cd6dd0ac7b6da039ba61a6cb33e4/eb79c/demo.webp 350w,\n/portfolio/static/bc78cd6dd0ac7b6da039ba61a6cb33e4/c91ae/demo.webp 700w,\n/portfolio/static/bc78cd6dd0ac7b6da039ba61a6cb33e4/035b6/demo.webp 1400w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"}]},"width":700,"height":305}}},"tech":["Django","ML","HTML","CSS"],"github":"https://github.com/kapil777/Railway-Feedback"},"html":"<p>This Feedback Detection and Classification system is a machine learning-based research project that automatically categorizes user feedback into predefined categories such as Police, Food, Cleanliness, and Maintenance. The front-end is built using HTML, CSS, and JavaScript to ensure a smooth user interface, while the back-end, powered by Django (Python), handles the processing and storage of feedback. By leveraging machine learning techniques, the system intelligently analyzes feedback and classifies it into relevant categories, making it easier for organizations to manage and address user concerns effectively.</p>"}},{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"College Timetable","cover":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/png;base64,"},"images":{"fallback":{"src":"/portfolio/static/4e06bd39766c182ea26b255309b1dee1/bc3b9/course-card.png","srcSet":"/portfolio/static/4e06bd39766c182ea26b255309b1dee1/9a130/course-card.png 175w,\n/portfolio/static/4e06bd39766c182ea26b255309b1dee1/a3fa1/course-card.png 350w,\n/portfolio/static/4e06bd39766c182ea26b255309b1dee1/bc3b9/course-card.png 700w,\n/portfolio/static/4e06bd39766c182ea26b255309b1dee1/87926/course-card.png 1400w","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/portfolio/static/4e06bd39766c182ea26b255309b1dee1/dae43/course-card.avif 175w,\n/portfolio/static/4e06bd39766c182ea26b255309b1dee1/d7667/course-card.avif 350w,\n/portfolio/static/4e06bd39766c182ea26b255309b1dee1/7ec1a/course-card.avif 700w,\n/portfolio/static/4e06bd39766c182ea26b255309b1dee1/71a30/course-card.avif 1400w","type":"image/avif","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},{"srcSet":"/portfolio/static/4e06bd39766c182ea26b255309b1dee1/5d873/course-card.webp 175w,\n/portfolio/static/4e06bd39766c182ea26b255309b1dee1/26a00/course-card.webp 350w,\n/portfolio/static/4e06bd39766c182ea26b255309b1dee1/f23f0/course-card.webp 700w,\n/portfolio/static/4e06bd39766c182ea26b255309b1dee1/2c2d0/course-card.webp 1400w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"}]},"width":700,"height":394}}},"tech":["Flask","HTML","CSS"],"github":"https://github.com/kapil777/AbesecTimetable"},"html":"<p>This project is designed to develop a software solution for colleges to efficiently manage and maintain \"Time Tables\" for both students and staff. It enables the creation, editing, and viewing of schedules in a structured and user-friendly manner. The front-end is built using HTML, CSS, and JavaScript, while Django (Python) is used on the back-end to handle data securely and ensure smooth system performance. This solution helps automate the scheduling process, minimizing conflicts and improving overall academic coordination.</p>"}}]}}}